WEBVTT

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:07.480
The Some Dead Fish Eyes, Not Enough Sunlight, Shuttle Run Club...

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:13.400
Ah! I finally found it, the home page of those girls' circle.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.150
Huh?

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.120
They dont even have a list of their works!

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.980
Are they even trying with this website?

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:20.940
This is a tremendous blasphemy.

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:24.540
They don't grasp her magnificence at all!

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:29.000
I will show them the light, one by one!

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:09.940
The closing party was so much fun.

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:12.240
Really? That's good.

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:14.660
You really joined a nice club, Tama-chan.

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:17.500
Your senpai are kind too.

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:20.240
Though, I was worried in the beginning.

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:23.990
Hahaha, you sound like my papa, Yumine.

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:26.780
Is that a compliment?

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:37.960
That's right! The manga you lent me was really interesting.

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:41.010
Really? Let me know your thoughts about it later.

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:44.720
I'm dropping by my club before class.

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:47.900
Right! I understand, do your best!

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:52.320
Yumine has been my friend since elementary school.

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:58.360
We got separated in middle school, but we're together again for high school.

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:01.560
She is a very special friend of mine.

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:03.640
The lyrics?

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:07.040
Yeah, up until now, I've relied on others for the lyrics,

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:11.080
but Teru-senpai asked me to write a song with vocals.

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:13.990
If it's you, Fujikawa-san, I'm sure you can do it easily.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:18.720
Not really, this time I haven't had any inspiration yet.

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:23.440
We're relying on you for the next project too. I'm working on some ideas now.

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:24.040
Ah!

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:30.060
I think about you in my last hours.

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:33.160
If I had the power to move your heart...

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:34.690
Oh? Did you get inspired?

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:38.440
It's been a while since I read a manga in one sitting like yesterday.

00:03:39.020 --> 00:03:43.180
A work that tenderly depicts the pain of a hidden love...

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:48.120
Huh? Fujikawa-senpai?

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:51.330
You were everything to me.

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:52.290
Eh?

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:59.140
If it's my destiny to disappear, I have to say that I loved you for an eternity.

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:03.460
Oh? Hi, Honda-chan.

00:04:03.820 --> 00:04:05.700
Um... What you said earlier...

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:08.600
I was writing a poem for my senpai.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:09.860
For your senpai...

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:16.460
Because that person is really important to me, I want to give it my all, even if I'm not very good.

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:23.450
Senpai, I like you!

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:26.180
I'm sure your feelings will reach him!

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:30.580
That's right! Can you help me with it, Honda-chan?

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:33.500
Eh? Is it ok if I help?

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:38.000
Of course, once I finish this,
we'll start with the next one.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:41.160
Aren't you expressing your feelings to your senpai? Who's the next one for?

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:44.040
Who? Umm...

00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:46.440
Seki-san I guess?

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:47.930
Forbidden love?!

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:49.390
I like you!

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:54.680
H-how should I put it? Even if she's a girl, I don't think it's right to play around.

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:55.350
Huh?

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:58.980
Anyway, can you come to my classroom at lunch break?

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:02.950
I have to support Fujikawa-senpai's love...

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:06.660
I-I'm inexperienced, but I'll do my best!

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:12.220
I want to hear your usual take on love, like when you talk about your father.

00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:13.370
Eh?!

00:05:13.800 --> 00:05:14.540
I like you!

00:05:14.860 --> 00:05:16.500
I like my papa!

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:20.800
Won't that just complicate things?

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:27.190
Ohh, maybe a messy and hopeless
situation would have more impact.

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:29.600
You thieving cat!

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:31.740
Isn't that obviously wrong?!

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:37.700
Will it really be okay?

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:42.040
Tama-chan has been spacing out for a while now...

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:43.560
Here.

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:45.820
A note!

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:49.640
Are you feeling well? Are you thinking about love or something?

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:50.660
How sharp.

00:05:54.740 --> 00:06:00.100
Fujikawa-senpai is in a messy romantic situation right now and I'm helping her.

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:00.840
Eh?!

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:05.980
It's your fault. You got too close to my Fujikawa-senpai!

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:09.340
Thank you, Honda-chan, now then...

00:06:11.320 --> 00:06:14.430
That blonde!

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:22.100
You take composing so seriously that it makes me jealous.

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:26.620
Really? Well, I really think of my works as my children.

00:06:29.060 --> 00:06:32.120
I mean, I don't have a resolution like yours, Fujikawa-san.

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:34.220
Resolution?

00:06:34.220 --> 00:06:37.740
Sure, I guess I could even say I'm in love with them.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:41.590
I don't mind facing hardships or devoting my life to them.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:44.700
H-how cool.

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:49.510
But it's not that easy to earn a living with the arts.

00:06:51.100 --> 00:06:53.220
Putting aside the thing about becoming a professional or not,

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:56.120
I was just talking about how I approach music.

00:06:56.120 --> 00:07:00.660
I often can't sleep because I'm trying to put my thoughts in order all night.

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:03.230
Aren't you just disorganized, Fujikawa-san?

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:07.950
Sleeping is necessary, it'll just backfire if you push your body too much.

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:10.100
You should have better sense than that.

00:07:10.100 --> 00:07:11.580
It's okay, it's okay.

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:17.260
Fujikawa-senpai is really passionate, but the president is more level-headed.

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:18.340
Huh?

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:19.880
Honda-san!

00:07:19.880 --> 00:07:22.460
I think both are wonderful!

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:23.140
Huh?

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:27.720
Sorry for making you wait, let's talk in the DTM club room.

00:07:27.720 --> 00:07:28.100
Okay.

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:32.740
Come in, come in.

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:36.850
Um... we're going to make it now, right?

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:38.560
That's right.

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:43.000
We're making a child.

00:07:43.220 --> 00:07:44.940
Ehhhh?

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:48.540
In a place like this? Wait, I'm a girl-

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:50.150
Come on, sit down.

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:52.400
What does your gender have to do with anything?

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:59.780
Ah, right, wasn't there a scene like this in the scenario I received from senpai?

00:07:59.780 --> 00:08:06.340
Inside my narrow cell, I think of you. On a make-believe rendezvous that hides our pain-

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:10.800
Wha- what is she doing? What am I getting into?

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:16.890
I have to sort this out. I'm alone with Fujikawa-senpai in her other club's room.

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.760
Hm? Do you have a question?

00:08:19.110 --> 00:08:21.700
We're making it together, right?

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:23.770
A... child.

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:30.900
That's right. But since we're making it for my senpai, it'll be theirs eventually.

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:34.680
Where did I put that scenario...

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:40.040
But what about the complicated family structure, and the troubles that could come?

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:43.680
Ah, right, a messy situation would make things better, right?

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:44.920
It won't!

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:49.300
Speaking of that, Murakami-san was scolding me earlier. She said I should have better sense-

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:51.320
Of course you should!

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:53.320
Anyway, let's start making it.

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:56.460
I...

00:08:57.920 --> 00:08:58.680
That...

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:01.300
Take a look at the scenario first.

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:03.000
No!

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:05.040
Ah, wai-

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:07.980
Sorry.

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:13.940
Tama-chan!

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:15.570
Yumine!

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:17.780
Hm? What's the matter?

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:19.120
This girl...

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:22.140
is on day duty today!

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:24.140
Sorry, we have something to do!

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:25.000
Honda-chan!

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:26.820
Ah, uh?

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:32.760
Tama-chan, are you all right?

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:33.960
Ah, yeah.

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:37.180
Actually, I think I misunderstood.

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:38.680
Misunderstood?

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:42.000
Fujikawa-senpai said something about a scenario...

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:53.030
I get it! She probably meant that her songs are like children to her.

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:55.280
Children? What about children?

00:09:55.280 --> 00:10:01.300
Ah, Fujikawa-senpai kind of asked me to make a child with her, so I got nervous.

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:03.240
Ehhhhh?!

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:10.300
It's your fault, Senpai, for playing with my feelings.

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:14.200
Is it only your feelings you want me to play with?

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:20.840
What am I doing fantasizing about my friend turned into a man!

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:22.540
Conditioned reflexes are scary...

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:23.880
Yu-Yumine.

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:29.040
I don't understand the specifics, but I'm rooting for you!

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:31.580
Ah, um...

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:33.780
thanks.

00:10:42.440 --> 00:10:46.100
After that, fortunately I was able to clear the misunderstanding,

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:51.200
but I was happy that Yumine was worried about me.

00:10:53.240 --> 00:10:58.900
Come to think of it, it was also because of her that I got into making videogames.

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:07.780
She came with me to check out the SNS Club, but that's not all.

00:11:11.340 --> 00:11:17.800
When I first thought of joining the SNS Club, I wanted to make a game myself.

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:19.200
That was because...

00:11:20.260 --> 00:11:22.500
Then we'll ask Honda Tamaki-san today.

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:24.500
Honda-san?

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:26.380
Honda-san!

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:28.800
Wah! I'm listening, Sensei!

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:30.000
Don't get distracted.

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:32.240
I'm asking you to deliver this printout.

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:33.960
Erm, where?

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:38.170
See, you weren't listening. To Fuda-san's house.

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:40.000
You live in her neighborhood, right?

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:43.000
Fuda Yumine-san...

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:47.500
I went to kindergarten with Fuda-san.

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:51.880
Even back then, she was frail and was often in the infirmary.

00:11:51.880 --> 00:11:53.060
I see.

00:11:53.340 --> 00:11:58.820
And when she wasn't she often played alone. She's a bit hard to talk to.

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:01.360
I guess she doesn't like crowds.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.820
It's like she lives in her own world.

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:09.540
She's in for some hardships at school if she doesn't learn to socialize better-

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:17.580
Honda-san, what are you looking at?

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:18.880
Ah, sorry!

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:22.080
I wonder if I can become friends with Yumine-chan.

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:24.740
That may be a bit hard.

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:28.380
Ah, go straight this way and you'll reach her house.

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:29.500
See you tomorrow.

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:30.960
See you.

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:40.520
I was often called absent-minded too, so I thought perhaps we could get along.

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:48.360
I'm Honda Tamaki, a friend of
Yumine-chan's. I came to play.

00:12:48.360 --> 00:12:51.200
Welcome, please come in.

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:56.480
Excuse me.

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:00.670
Do you need something?

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:02.880
Hello, Yumine-chan.

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:04.540
Umm...

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:07.660
I came to deliver this printout.

00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:11.180
You could have given that to my mom at the door.

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:14.100
Oh? She said she came to play.

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:16.220
Well then, make yourself at home.

00:13:16.220 --> 00:13:17.040
Okay!

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:20.860
Pleased to meet you, I'm Honda Tamaki.

00:13:22.680 --> 00:13:24.960
Say, let's play together.

00:13:24.960 --> 00:13:30.460
Eh? No way. I'm too frail to play outside,

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:33.140
and I'm playing a video game now.

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:35.900
I see! Then' I'll draw.

00:13:50.020 --> 00:13:51.440
I can't focus.

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:55.770
Honda-chan, are you going to have dinner here?

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:58.020
No, I'll go home.

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:00.900
Ah, it's already this late!

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:05.500
Ehehe, I get to have dinner with Papa today.

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:10.560
Bye bye, Yumine-chan! Let's play again tomorrow!

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:17.700
Did we play today?

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:26.660
Hello!

00:14:27.360 --> 00:14:28.560
I'm coming in!

00:14:29.900 --> 00:14:32.700
Yumine-chan, you missed school again today.

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:36.120
I don't want to go to school. I have a slight fever anyway.

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:41.100
Thinking back on it, we didn't play together yesterday.

00:14:41.100 --> 00:14:42.880
She finally realized.

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:44.240
And so today...

00:14:45.060 --> 00:14:45.760
Ta-da!

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:49.580
I asked my grandma to let me bring our game console.

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:52.740
What generation is that from? I don't know it.

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:56.450
Eh, what? She said a handheld game console had to be this.

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:59.760
What software did you want to play to begin with?

00:14:59.760 --> 00:15:02.480
Software...? Is that like softball?

00:15:03.660 --> 00:15:06.500
Th- then let's have a chat!

00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:14.000
Today I was having lunch with my friends, Nozomi-chan and Karin-chan...

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:17.300
Nozomi-chan hates peppers, so...

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:22.960
Yumine's a bit hard to approach, right?

00:15:23.870 --> 00:15:25.480
She looks gloomy...

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:28.700
The teachers favor frail kids like her.

00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:32.940
I don't really like peppers either,

00:15:32.940 --> 00:15:36.260
but Karin-chan said you can get used to them, so...

00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:37.320
Go home.

00:15:37.940 --> 00:15:38.360
Eh?

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:39.940
Go home!

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:42.940
I don't want to hear about your friends!

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:55.180
Say, Nozomi-chan,

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:57.960
why did we become friends?

00:15:58.980 --> 00:16:00.600
Is that a philosophical question?

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:02.570
Philosophical?

00:16:02.570 --> 00:16:06.520
Our seats were close, so we'd eat lunch together...

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:10.840
then we started talking and playing together.

00:16:11.180 --> 00:16:13.950
Oh! I landed a big job!

00:16:14.560 --> 00:16:20.700
I can't play with Yumine, or have a conversation with her. What should I do?

00:16:21.680 --> 00:16:23.040
Honda-san, Honda-san.

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:25.760
Throw the dice.

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:27.440
Ah, right.

00:16:27.440 --> 00:16:29.060
You really are absent-minded.

00:16:30.320 --> 00:16:31.380
Can I join?

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:32.130
Okay.

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:35.800
I like rainy days because we can bring games and play in the classroom.

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:39.000
Although we can only play during lunch break and after school.

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:42.940
I wonder if I could play a board game at Yumine-chan's house.

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:47.480
I think she'd just be bothered if a lot of people showed up.

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:50.570
And you're supposed to play this with many people.

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:53.400
Is there a board game you can play with two people?

00:16:53.840 --> 00:16:56.860
Like shogi, go, or chess?

00:16:56.860 --> 00:16:59.400
I don't know the rules for those.

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:04.580
If there aren't any, why don't you make one and play it?

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:05.820
Just kidding!

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:15.680
Then, when I got home, I started drawing a board game in a notebook.

00:17:16.860 --> 00:17:20.360
Of course, it wasn't as pretty as a commercial one,

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:25.020
but I tried my best with it, writing in small letters and everything.

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:36.440
Yumine-chan!

00:17:39.960 --> 00:17:41.360
Let's play!

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:48.250
Erm, should I throw the dice again?

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:53.640
W-wait! Just when I was done with my five-turn break from being struck by lightning...

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:55.900
Eh? Go back eight places?

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:58.260
D-don't ask me.

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:01.760
Didn't you make this in the first place?

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:06.230
I did, but I didn't plan to keep falling on this kind of square...

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:09.440
You're weird, Honda-san.

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:20.340
After that, I would come up with all sorts of games, draw them, and play them with Yumine.

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:23.820
We did all sorts of things,

00:18:23.820 --> 00:18:29.780
and I got to have someone play and enjoy themselves with something I made.

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:35.180
And I thought that was wonderful.

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:39.360
Why is this token's face an old man?

00:18:39.860 --> 00:18:41.980
I-I thought it was cool.

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:54.000
Yumine started laughing more,

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:56.720
and coming to school more often,

00:18:56.720 --> 00:18:58.620
and made more friends.

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:04.120
Amazing! You know so much about games and manga, Yumine-chan!

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:06.820
Can I come over to play sometime?

00:19:06.820 --> 00:19:10.090
Of course. If there's a manga you want to read, I'll lend it to you.

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:12.090
Really? Yay?

00:19:12.090 --> 00:19:14.090
Thanks, Yumine-chan!

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:17.580
I didn't know Yumine-chan was this lively.

00:19:19.740 --> 00:19:22.040
I made a new game today!

00:19:26.960 --> 00:19:30.480
I also borrowed Yumine's game console,

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:34.360
and Yumine started drawing, perhaps because of my influence.

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:45.660
I like the main character the most in this manga. So cool!

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:49.400
Eh? His dad's way better!

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:29.950
Then...

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:36.500
It's settled! I'm drawing messy, brutish BL with these characters next!

00:20:37.260 --> 00:20:40.980
Is it okay to draw that kind of thing in the illustration Club?

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:48.180
I'm in negotiations to have it included in a compilation book! You go home first, Tama-chan!

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:50.300
Ah! Yumine!

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:04.240
Yumine dashed away, so I'm going home alone today.

00:21:05.100 --> 00:21:10.780
It seems she's enjoying her club too, so I feel happy.

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:15.720
Because of games, I became friends with Yumine,

00:21:15.720 --> 00:21:20.240
and I met the president, Seki-senpai and Fujikawa-senpai.

00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:26.240
I hope I can get along with all sorts of people through games in the future too.

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:28.240
Ah!

00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:32.040
Eh? Who are you?

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:35.900
After I finally managed to track down your hideout,

00:21:35.900 --> 00:21:39.260
I gathered my resolve and went to challenge each of you,

00:21:39.260 --> 00:21:42.360
and you had the nerve to make a fool of me?!

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:46.570
Eh? Who is this girl? Eh, eh?

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:24.920
Have a contest with me right now!

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:27.260
Huh? What's with that serious look?

00:23:27.260 --> 00:23:28.100
Ahhhhh!

00:23:28.100 --> 00:23:30.880
I think it'd be better not to reveal my identity at this point.

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:32.940
I went with kinpira-style burdock!
